1
00:00:18,957 --> 00:00:22,241
Waouh, une fête foraine !
Wow, a fun fair!

2
00:00:23,741 --> 00:00:28,777
Regarde ! Il y a de la barbe à papa !
Look! There is cotton candy!

3
00:00:30,447 --> 00:00:35,051
Bonjour, deux barbes à papa, s'il vous plaît.
Hello, two cotton candies, please.

4
00:00:36,051 --> 00:00:38,711
Merci beaucoup !
Thank you very much!

5
00:00:41,611 --> 00:00:44,151
C'est délicieux !
It's delicious!

6
00:00:44,251 --> 00:00:47,487
Oui, c'est très sucré !
Yes, it's very sweet!

7
00:00:50,158 --> 00:00:53,754
Achetons des billets pour les manèges !
Let's buy tickets for the rides!

8
00:00:54,754 --> 00:00:58,086
Maintenant, on peut monter !
Now we can ride!

9
00:01:04,146 --> 00:01:06,782
C'était amusant !
That was fun!

10
00:01:08,182 --> 00:01:11,490
Maintenant, la grande roue !
Now, the Ferris wheel!

11
00:01:23,318 --> 00:01:27,682
C'est très haut ! Génial !
It's very high! Great!

12
00:01:30,867 --> 00:01:33,479
Quelle belle journée !
What a great day!

13
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,187
Revenons bientôt !
Let's come back soon!
